# Exclude list for tests that fail or stall only with --kernel-passthrough
#
# A write through a passthrough mmap goes to the backing file and never reaches
# the daemon, so stat() on the FUSE file shows the old mtime and ctime until
# the attributes the kernel caches time out.
generic/080
generic/215
# generic/323 runs 100 threads of O_DIRECT AIO reads. With passthrough they go
# to the host disk without the daemon, and on the CI runners the test took 30
# minutes instead of 2 or stalled the runner.
generic/323
